        "created_at": "2026-05-03 08:02:04",
        "updated_at": "2026-10-13 00:22:07",
        "slug": "kathy-kelly",
        "body": "<p><strong>2014\u20132015 custody episode verified October 12, 2026:</strong> Kelly's <a href=\"https://www.countercurrents.org/kelly121214.htm\">original sentencing account</a> documents June 1, 2014 arrest and December 10 sentencing. Medea Benjamin's <a href=\"https://truthout.org/articles/federal-prison-sentence-begins-for-anti-drone-activist/\">January 26 interview report</a> confirms the sentence began January 23, 2015. In her <a href=\"https://znetwork.org/zmagazine/an-interview-with-kathy-kelly/\">later first-person interview</a>, read in the browser, Kelly explicitly identifies April 21 as the day she walked out of Lexington's prison. This actual endpoint is distinguished from the anticipated April 23 date. The separate episode replaces neither the earlier prosecutions nor the later case; the false uninterrupted aggregate duration was removed.</p>",
